Package: calcy
Version: $(VERSION)
Section: math
Priority: optional
Architecture: $(ARCH)
Installed-Size: $(SIZE_KB)
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libicu76 | libicu75 | libicu74 | libicu73 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70 | libicu67, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libice6, libsm6
Recommends: fonts-dejavu-core
Maintainer: alexander-miglis <alexander-miglis@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/alexander-miglis/calcy
Description: 8-bit graphing calculator with exact maths
 Calcy is a desktop graphing calculator: exact arithmetic, a computer algebra
 system, graphing, statistics, matrices, finance, unit conversion, a formula
 collection, notebooks and a sandboxed Python interpreter. It also installs
 calcy-cli, a terminal calculator and MCP server for AI assistants.